      "bm25": [
        {
          "id": "nist_good_password::chunk-31",
          "content": "1. Set up multifactor authentication. Passkeys are a great option.\n2. Use a password manager.\n3. If you must make a password, make sure it’s at least 15 characters long. A passphrase can help you come up with something long and memorable.",
          "metadata": {
